#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0355 expect=noViolation domain=AE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the --DETECT variable is present in the dataset, since --DETECT is defined for use in non-clinical (SEND) studies and must never be used in the submission of SDTM-based data for human clinical trials.
#note "AEDETECT column absent from the dataset"
dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AESEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 2
---
